    {
      "name": "Mass Wriggle",
      "actions": -1,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The rat snake swarm takes damage from a melee Strike</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Snakes slither up and around the creature's weapon and limbs. The target must succeed at a DC 15 Will save or become Frightened 1.</p>",
